---
import GovLayout from '../layouts/GovLayout.astro';
---
<GovLayout title="규정·공공조달·점검 | 대한불교밀교종">
  <div class="compliance-app" data-app data-compliance-version="2026-08-16-v75-ui-table-date" hidden>
    <header class="topbar">
      <a href="/accounting-compliance/" class="brand"><img src="/brand-logo-transparent.png" alt="대한불교밀교종 로고" /><span><img src="/brand-wordmark-symbol.svg" alt="대한불교밀교종" /><b>규정·공공조달·점검</b></span></a>
      <div class="top-actions"><span data-user-label></span><a href="/" class="btn btn-outline">전자문서</a><a href="/accounting/" class="btn btn-outline">기본 회계</a><a href="/accounting-special/" class="btn btn-outline">특화회계</a><a href="/accounting-operations/" class="btn btn-outline">실무관리</a><a href="/accounting-tax/" class="btn btn-outline">세무·신고자료</a><button class="btn btn-outline" data-logout>로그아웃</button></div>
    </header>
    <div class="shell">
      <aside class="sidebar">
        <div class="year-box"><label for="compliance-year">회계연도</label><select id="compliance-year" data-year></select></div>
        <nav>
          <button class="nav active" data-tab="overview">규정대응 현황</button>
          <button class="nav" data-tab="revenue">수익사업 관리</button>
          <button class="nav" data-tab="procurement">공공조달 관리</button>
          <button class="nav" data-tab="reserve">고유목적사업준비금</button>
          <button class="nav" data-tab="check">회계점검·즉시보고</button>
          <button class="nav" data-tab="vehicle">업무용 차량</button>
        </nav>
        <p class="side-note">정관·재무회계규정에 따라 승인근거, 의결번호, 증빙과 점검이력을 연결해 관리합니다.</p>
      </aside>
      <main class="main">
        <div class="notice" data-notice hidden></div>

        <section class="panel active" data-panel="overview">
          <div class="heading"><div><p>REGULATION COMPLIANCE</p><h1>정관·재무회계규정 대응 현황</h1><span>수익사업, 공공조달, 준비금, 정기점검, 즉시보고, 업무용 차량을 기존 회계자료와 연결합니다.</span></div></div>
          <div class="summary-grid">
            <button data-jump="revenue"><span>수익사업 관리</span><strong data-summary-revenue>0건</strong><small>검토·승인·운영 중</small></button>
            <button data-jump="procurement"><span>공공조달 검토</span><strong data-summary-procurement>0건</strong><small>검토·승인·계약 중</small></button>
            <button data-jump="reserve"><span>준비금 잔액</span><strong data-summary-reserve>0원</strong><small>설정액-사용·환입액</small></button>
            <button data-jump="check"><span>미종결 점검·보고</span><strong data-summary-check>0건</strong><small>점검+즉시보고</small></button>
            <button data-jump="vehicle"><span>업무용 차량</span><strong data-summary-vehicle>0대</strong><small>운행·보험·계약 관리</small></button>
            <button data-jump="procurement"><span>45일 내 보증만료</span><strong data-summary-guarantee>0건</strong><small>회수·하자종료 확인</small></button>
          </div>
          <div class="card guide-grid">
            <button data-jump="revenue"><b>1. 수익사업 사전검토</b><span>정관 근거와 예상 수입·지출, 허가·세무 및 승인단계를<br />기록합니다.</span></button>
            <button data-jump="procurement"><b>2. 입찰참가 검토</b><span>참가자격·원가·손익·보증·세무·위험과 연간 총량한도를<br />확인합니다.</span></button>
            <button data-jump="reserve"><b>3. 준비금 이력관리</b><span>설정·사용·환입·기한을 회계연도별로<br />관리합니다.</span></button>
            <button data-jump="check"><b>4. 회계점검·즉시보고</b><span>대사·증빙·예산·첨부무결성·조달위험을 점검하고<br />이상사항을 보고합니다.</span></button>
          </div>
          <div class="card rule-note"><h2>자동 통제 기준</h2><p>공공조달은 추정가격 5천만원 이상, 1회계연도 초과, 차입·보증, 중대한 재정위험 또는 연간 계약총액이 직전연도 총수입의 50%를 넘으면 이사회 의결 대상으로 안내하며, 기본재산 담보는 총회·주무관청 절차까지 표시합니다.</p><div class="limit-strip"><span>직전연도 총수입 <b data-prior-income>0원</b></span><span>50% 총량한도 <b data-procurement-limit>0원</b></span><span>현재 계약누계 <b data-procurement-total>0원</b></span></div></div>
        </section>

        <section class="panel" data-panel="revenue">
          <div class="heading"><div><p>REVENUE BUSINESS</p><h1>수익사업 시행·변경·중단 관리</h1><span>사업별 정관상 근거, 예상 손익, 등록·허가·세무 검토와 승인근거를 보존합니다.</span></div><a class="btn btn-outline" href="/?compose=1&template=TPL-FIN-REVENUE-BUSINESS">전자문서 검토서 작성</a></div>
          <form class="card manager-only" data-revenue-form>
            <input type="hidden" name="id" />
            <div class="form-grid four">
              <label>처리구분<select name="actionType"><option value="new">신설</option><option value="change">변경</option><option value="stop">중단</option></select></label>
              <label>사업유형<select name="businessType" required><option value="education">교육·강좌·수련</option><option value="content">출판·디지털콘텐츠</option><option value="goods">종교·문화상품</option><option value="experience">체험·명상·마음돌봄</option><option value="facility">시설사용·대관</option><option value="event">전시·공연·문화행사</option><option value="online">온라인·전자상거래</option><option value="procurement">공공조달</option><option value="preferential_purchase">우선구매 인증·지정</option><option value="other">기타</option></select></label>
              <label class="span-2">사업명<input name="title" required /></label>
              <label class="span-2">정관·규정 근거<input name="charterBasis" value="정관 제5조·제6조 / 재무회계규정 제10조의2~제10조의4" /></label>
              <label>시작일<input name="startDate" type="date" /></label><label>종료일<input name="endDate" type="date" /></label>
              <label>예상수입<input name="expectedIncome" class="money" inputmode="numeric" /></label><label>예상지출<input name="expectedExpense" class="money" inputmode="numeric" /></label>
              <label>담당부서<select name="department" data-org-department-select><option value="">담당부서 선택</option></select></label><label>담당자<select name="managerName" data-org-manager-select><option value="">담당자 선택</option></select></label>
              <label>등록·허가 검토<select name="permitStatus"><option value="review">검토중</option><option value="not_required">해당없음</option><option value="complete">완료</option></select></label>
              <label>세무 검토<select name="taxReviewStatus"><option value="review">검토중</option><option value="complete">완료</option><option value="external_review">외부전문가 검토</option></select></label>
              <label>자동 승인단계<input name="approvalLevel" data-revenue-approval value="이사회 의결" readonly /></label>
              <label>의결번호<input name="decisionNo" placeholder="이사회·총회 대상 시 입력" /></label>
              <div class="span-4 check-grid revenue-approval-checks"><label><input type="checkbox" name="routineAnnualPlan" /> 연간 사업계획·예산에 포함된 반복·통상 사업</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="majorPurposeImpact" /> 목적·주요 사업범위에 중대한 영향</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="basicPropertyImpact" /> 기본재산·중대한 시설투자 영향</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="borrowingGuaranteeImpact" /> 장기·대규모 차입·보증 수반</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="majorFinancialBurden" /> 중대한 재정부담·존립재산 영향</label></div>
              <div class="span-4 approval-inline-note" data-revenue-approval-reason>기본: 이사회 의결 · 반복·통상 사업만 이사장 승인 가능</div>
              <label>상태<select name="status"><option value="review">검토</option><option value="approved">승인</option><option value="active">운영중</option><option value="stopped">중단</option></select></label>
              <label class="span-3">비고<textarea name="memo"></textarea></label>
            </div>
            <div class="form-actions"><button class="btn btn-primary">저장</button></div>
          </form>
          <div class="card"><div class="card-head"><h2>수익사업 관리대장</h2><button class="btn btn-outline" data-load-revenue>새로고침</button></div><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>관리번호</th><th>사업명</th><th>구분</th><th>기간</th><th>예상수입</th><th>예상지출</th><th>승인</th><th>상태</th><th>첨부</th></tr></thead><tbody data-revenue-rows></tbody></table></div></div>
        </section>

        <section class="panel" data-panel="procurement">
          <div class="heading"><div><p>PUBLIC PROCUREMENT</p><h1>공공조달 입찰참가·계약 위험관리</h1><span>입찰 전 참가자격, 원가·손익, 보증, 세무, 이해관계, 승인단계와 연간 총량한도를 자동 검토합니다.</span></div><a class="btn btn-outline" href="/?compose=1&template=TPL-FIN-PROCUREMENT-REVIEW">입찰참가 검토서 작성</a></div>
          <form class="card manager-only" data-procurement-form>
            <input type="hidden" name="id" />
            <div class="form-section-title">1. 공고·계약 개요</div>
            <div class="form-grid four">
              <label>발주기관<input name="agency" required /></label><label>공고번호<input name="announcementNo" /></label><label class="span-2">공고명<input name="title" required /></label>
              <label>입찰방식<select name="bidMethod"><option value="competitive">경쟁입찰</option><option value="negotiation">협상</option><option value="quotation">견적·수의</option><option value="other">기타</option></select></label><label>입찰일<input name="bidDate" type="date" /></label><label>개찰일<input name="openingDate" type="date" /></label><label>납품기한<input name="deliveryDueDate" type="date" /></label>
              <label>추정가격<input name="estimatedPrice" class="money preview-trigger" inputmode="numeric" /></label><label>투찰예정금액<input name="plannedBidAmount" class="money preview-trigger" inputmode="numeric" /></label><label>계약금액<input name="actualContractAmount" class="money preview-trigger" inputmode="numeric" /></label><label>직전연도 총수입 직접입력<input name="priorYearIncomeOverride" class="money preview-trigger" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="자동계산 불가 시" /></label>
              <label>계약시작<input name="contractStart" type="date" class="preview-trigger" /></label><label>계약종료<input name="contractEnd" type="date" class="preview-trigger" /></label><label>납품장소<input name="deliveryPlace" /></label><label>책임자(담당자)<select name="responsibleUserId" data-procurement-responsible-select><option value="">책임자 선택</option></select></label>
              <label>연결 수익사업<select name="revenueBusinessId" data-revenue-select><option value="">선택 안 함</option></select><small>승인 이후에는 공공조달·우선구매 유형 수익사업 연결이 필수입니다.</small></label><label>연결 기존계약<select name="contractId" data-contract-select><option value="">선택 안 함</option></select><small>계약 확정 시 수익사업회계로 등록한 계약을 연결합니다.</small></label><label>상태<select name="status"><option value="review">검토</option><option value="approved">승인</option><option value="contracted">계약</option><option value="completed">완료</option><option value="withdrawn">철회</option></select></label><label>부가가치세<select name="vatStatus"><option value="review">확인필요</option><option value="taxable">과세</option><option value="exempt">면세</option></select></label>
            </div>
            <div class="form-section-title">2. 참가자격·위험 확인</div>
            <div class="check-grid procurement-check-grid">
              <label><input type="checkbox" name="businessRegistrationOk" /> 수익사업 개시신고·사업자등록 확인</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="biddingRegistrationOk" /> 입찰참가자격 등록 확인</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="qualificationOk" /> 면허·인증·직접생산 등 확인</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="competitionOk" /> 경쟁제품 등 참가가능성 확인</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="sanctionClear" /> 입찰참가 제한 등 결격사유 없음</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="charterScopeOk" /> 정관상 수익사업 범위 해당</label>
              <label><input type="checkbox" name="relatedParty" /> 이해관계인 관련성 있음</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="borrowingOrGuarantee" class="preview-trigger" /> 차입·보증 수반</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="basicPropertyCollateral" class="preview-trigger" /> 기본재산 담보 관련</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="materialFinancialRisk" class="preview-trigger" /> 중대한 재정영향 우려</label>
            </div>
            <div class="form-section-title">3. 원가·손익·세무</div>
            <div class="form-grid four">
              <label>재료·물품구입비<input name="costMaterial" class="money preview-trigger" inputmode="numeric" /></label><label>외주·하도급비<input name="costOutsource" class="money preview-trigger" inputmode="numeric" /></label><label>인건비<input name="costLabor" class="money preview-trigger" inputmode="numeric" /></label><label>운반·설치·포장비<input name="costDelivery" class="money preview-trigger" inputmode="numeric" /></label>
              <label>보증료·수수료<input name="costGuarantee" class="money preview-trigger" inputmode="numeric" /></label><label>기타 경비<input name="costOther" class="money preview-trigger" inputmode="numeric" /></label><label>예비비<input name="costContingency" class="money preview-trigger" inputmode="numeric" /></label><label>고유목적사업준비금<select name="purposeReserveReview"><option value="review">검토필요</option><option value="applicable">설정 검토</option><option value="not_applicable">미해당</option></select></label>
              <label>이행 실패 예상손실<input name="expectedLoss" class="money" inputmode="numeric" /></label><label class="span-3">대응방안<textarea name="responsePlan"></textarea></label>
            </div>
            <div class="approval-preview"><div><span>총 원가</span><b data-preview-cost>0원</b></div><div><span>예상이익</span><b data-preview-profit>0원</b></div><div><span>예상이익률</span><b data-preview-profit-rate>0%</b></div><div><span>자동 승인단계</span><b data-preview-approval>이사장 승인</b></div><div class="wide"><span>판단사유</span><b data-preview-reasons>연간 사업계획·예산 범위 내 통상 처리</b><small data-preview-profit-warning></small></div><div><span>계약 후 연간누계</span><b data-preview-annual>0원</b></div></div>
            <div class="form-grid four">
              <label>의결번호<input name="decisionNo" /></label><label>주무관청 허가번호<input name="authorityPermitNo" /></label><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="nextBoardReported" /> 이사장 승인 건 다음 이사회 보고 완료</label><label>다음 이사회 보고일<input name="nextBoardReportDate" type="date" /></label><label class="span-4">비고<textarea name="memo"></textarea></label>
            </div>
            <div class="form-actions"><button type="button" class="btn btn-outline" data-preview-procurement>자동검토</button><button class="btn btn-primary">저장</button></div>
          </form>
          <div class="card"><div class="card-head"><h2>공공조달 계약관리대장</h2><button class="btn btn-outline" data-load-procurement>새로고침</button></div><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>검토번호</th><th>발주기관·공고명</th><th>추정가격</th><th>투찰/계약</th><th>승인단계</th><th>책임자</th><th>연결계약</th><th>보증</th><th>상태</th><th>관리</th></tr></thead><tbody data-procurement-rows></tbody></table></div></div>
          <div class="two-cols" data-procurement-detail-area hidden>
            <form class="card manager-only" data-guarantee-form><h2>이행보증·하자보수 관리</h2><input type="hidden" name="procurementReviewId" /><div class="form-grid two"><label>보증종류<select name="guaranteeType"><option value="bid">입찰보증</option><option value="performance">계약이행보증</option><option value="advance">선금보증</option><option value="defect">하자보수보증</option></select></label><label>보증기관<input name="provider" required /></label><label>증권번호<input name="policyNo" /></label><label>보증금액<input name="amount" class="money" /></label><label>보증료<input name="fee" class="money" /></label><label>개시일<input name="startDate" type="date" /></label><label>만료일<input name="endDate" type="date" /></label><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="recovered" /> 회수·종료 확인</label></div><label>비고<textarea name="memo"></textarea></label><div class="form-actions"><button class="btn btn-primary">보증자료 저장</button></div></form>
            <div class="card"><h2>선택 입찰의 보증내역</h2><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>번호</th><th>종류</th><th>기관</th><th>금액</th><th>기간</th><th>상태</th></tr></thead><tbody data-guarantee-rows></tbody></table></div></div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="panel" data-panel="reserve">
          <div class="heading"><div><p>PURPOSE RESERVE</p><h1>고유목적사업준비금 관리대장</h1><span>설정액, 사용기한, 사용액, 환입액, 잔액과 세무검토 상태를 관리합니다.</span></div></div>
          <div class="two-cols manager-only">
